, \"text\": \"**Affiliation with Good Entertainment**\"}, {\"id\": \"s8\", \"text\": \"Uee is currently affiliated with Good Entertainment, a South Korean entertainment management company.\"}, {\"id\": \"s9\", \"text\": \"According to various sources, including news articles and industry reports, Uee signed an exclusive contract with Good Entertainment in 2017, following her departure from Pledis Entertainment, her previous management agency.\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"[1][2]\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"Good Entertainment, founded in 2000, is a leading entertainment management company in South Korea, representing a range of artists, including actors, singers, and models.\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"The company has a reputation for nurturing talented artists and providing them with opportunities for growth and development in the entertainment industry.\"}, {\"id\": \"s13\", \"text\": \"**References**\"}, {\"id\": \"s14\", \"text\": \"[1] \\\"Uee signs with Good Entertainment\\\" (in Korean).\"}, {\"id\": \"s15\", \"text\": \"Newsen.\"}, {\"id\": \"s16\", \"text\": \"2017-05-15.\"}, {\"id\": \"s17\", \"text\": \"Retrieved 2022-02-20.\"}, {\"id\": \"s18\", \"text\": \"[2] \\\"Uee joins Good Entertainment, starts new chapter\\\" (in Korean).\"}, {\"id\": \"s19\", \"text\": \"Osen.\"}, {\"id\": \"s20\", \"text\": \"2017-05-16.\"}, {\"id\": \"s21\", \"text\": \"Retrieved 2022-02-20.\"}]}"
